    "notes": "The issuer describes USDO and cUSDO as two formats of the same yield-bearing product. OpenEden Digital Limited is the underlying USDO issuer; the reviewed wrapper documentation does not separately identify a legal cUSDO issuer or a national-currency redemption obligation. This assessment concerns cUSDO independently of USDO and TBILL. Underlying reserve reports are not cUSDO-specific monthly attestations. Section 4(a)(11) regulates interest paid on payment stablecoins; interest alone is not an exclusion in section 2(22).",
